UeTzpCB5Tv84SknlSh5mOhNMrZzpQ&oe=6B1065F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape cover-Thanksgiving update 1.png", "id": "1669615414713060", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839738_1669615418046393_6588261786033158686_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9yQ13HRp2XQQ7kNvwFe0bIF&_nc_oc=AdrDAiDlCJRxd6dLh897g45RtKaN_qOWsFT-mDKOpkUDraguXOVNCUHO3Ue3bqGHjhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXKKBrgeFYxon6rpOSdqIpRGNrRZPGrbLqrNzgSzaxbVg&oe=6B104AF7"}, "display_name": "GRO", "keywords": ["Farming", "Garden", "Game", "trading", "Action"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                    \nBecome a TURKEY! Get stuffed with food, grow into a GIANT, and fight to survive! Will you be the LAST TURKEY STANDING?\n\n{1961694904718240}\n# TURKEY TASER TAG!\nMonkes use TASERS to tag the Turkey and STEAL its role! The Turkey fights back by GRABBING other players and EXPLODING their HEADS!\n# NEW THANKSGIVING SHOP!\nGrind for the ultimate TURKEY SEED! Unlock tasty plants like Roasted Carrot, Stuffed Mushroom, Fried Chicken, Bell Pepper, Candied Apple, Maple Syrup, and Deviled Eggs.\n{1471323561438861}\n# THANKSGIVING BLACK FRIDAY BUNDLES!\nDress up as COOKED TURKEY, FOOTBALL GRANNY or MAC N CHEESE PULL! Grab new bundles packed with PRESIDENTIAL TURKEY, KNIT FOOTBALL and MAC N CHEESE TORNADO seeds!\n\n{2021170175493065}\n# PETS BETA COMING SOON!!\nCollect rare seeds, trade with friends and join the best VR community.\n\nBecome a **GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro**\n", "short_description": "Plant, Harvest, GRO-w!\n\nA fantasy farming sandbox, where cozy farming meets multiplayer chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://grogame